[size=5][b]Improved Camera SE NG - Skyrim 1.7.x[/b][/size]
[i]The 1.7.99 / 1.7.104 build of ArranzCNL's Improved Camera SE.[/i]

Improved Camera SE is an SKSE plugin that enables the first person body and lets animations that Skyrim normally forces into third person play in first person too. This page has the DLL rebuilt for Skyrim 1.7.x with CommonLibSSE-NG, plus the start-up fix described below. The features, the INI profiles and the settings menu are the original mod's.

[line]

[size=4][b]What this build changes[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Runs on Skyrim 1.7.99 and 1.7.104 (built with CommonLibSSE-NG and Address Library).
[*]Fixes the start-up error "SKSE/Trampoline.cpp: failed to handle request" that the first 1.7 build could show.
[*]The download carries the license text, a notice with the copyright statement, and the link to the source code (see below).
[*]No other code was changed; the mod behaves like Improved Camera SE 1.1.2.
[/list]

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][url=https://skse.silverlock.org/]SKSE64[/url] for your Skyrim version
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/32444]Address Library for SKSE Plugins[/url]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install this download with your mod manager. It is a complete install: the DLL, the default ImprovedCameraSE.ini and profile, and the fonts.
[*]Disable the original [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/93962]Improved Camera SE[/url] while you use this one: both contain [b]SKSE\Plugins\ImprovedCameraSE.dll[/b].
[*]If you tuned the INI or profiles of the original, copy them over this download's files.
[/list]

[size=4][b]Known limits[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Built for Skyrim 1.7.x; this build is not tested on older game versions.
[*]Skyrim VR is not covered.
[/list]

[line]

