[list]
[*][b]Source code:[/b] [url=https://github.com/CageTV/ImprovedCameraSE-NG]https://github.com/CageTV/ImprovedCameraSE-NG[/url] (a fork of [url=https://github.com/ArranzCNL/ImprovedCameraSE-NG]ArranzCNL/ImprovedCameraSE-NG[/url]). The release tag matching this download is named in the GitHub release notes.
